    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master Maui\u2019s legendary shapeshifting powers to free the island from the corrupt force of Cemyk, a nefarious creature from another world.<br> <br>Features:  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Explore a Metroidvania-style Open World:</strong> Get lost in a 2D open world set on a Polynesian island featuring tropical forests, waterfalls, caves, volcanoes, and spiritual realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144750/extras/5480bac76d5a8553a18a45f1f0183d3e.poster.avif?t=1750971502\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144750/extras/5480bac76d5a8553a18a45f1f0183d3e.webm?t=1750971502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144750/extras/5480bac76d5a8553a18a45f1f0183d3e.mp4?t=1750971502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Large and Detailed Map:</strong> Discover a large map full of secrets and challenges, with tricky platforming and other obstacles to overcome. Conquer every corner to unlock new areas and obtain powerful abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144750/extras/e7663b0885ea50128e9984ea97d839f1.poster.avif?t=1750971502\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144750/extras/e7663b0885ea50128e9984ea97d839f1.webm?t=1750971502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144750/extras/e7663b0885ea50128e9984ea97d839f1.mp4?t=1750971502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Animal Transformations:</strong> Transform into wild animals big and small, each with distinct abilities to aid Maui in traversal and combat. Brave the island as a Green Sea Turtle, Happy Face Spider, a Kamehameha Butterfly, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144750/extras/b86002fd9cd308ccccbc3c7a45a64206.poster.avif?t=1750971502\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144750/extras/b86002fd9cd308ccccbc3c7a45a64206.webm?t=1750971502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144750/extras/b86002fd9cd308ccccbc3c7a45a64206.mp4?t=1750971502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Solve Environmental Puzzles:</strong> Take on the wilds of the island with Maui\u2019s iconic hook to deftly maneuver through the dense jungles and move earth and land to access new areas.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144750/extras/36b65bae9cad5f932e13f199b62997da.poster.avif?t=1750971502\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144750/extras/36b65bae9cad5f932e13f199b62997da.webm?t=1750971502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144750/extras/36b65bae9cad5f932e13f199b62997da.mp4?t=1750971502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Slot System:</strong>\u00a0Customize gameplay with a Slot System offering a variety of abilities and upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144750/extras/7e8421ef7ef8efe98d8c0ae36da16ba7.poster.avif?t=1750971502\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144750/extras/7e8421ef7ef8efe98d8c0ae36da16ba7.webm?t=1750971502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144750/extras/7e8421ef7ef8efe98d8c0ae36da16ba7.mp4?t=1750971502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Hand Paint Art Style:</strong> Bask in the beauty of 2D hand-painted environments, characters, and animations, crafted with attention to detail creating an immersive and eye-catching world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144750/extras/8b66a0b78b444ac5107b5a1e8b01055f.poster.avif?t=1750971502\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144750/extras/8b66a0b78b444ac5107b5a1e8b01055f.webm?t=1750971502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144750/extras/8b66a0b78b444ac5107b5a1e8b01055f.mp4?t=1750971502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
